    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Draw on the Debilitating Power of the Void</p></blockquote><p>The Shadow Domain deals with the powers of shadow and the Void, a sinister mirror of the life-giving Light. Clerics who embrace these powers can wither their enemies' flesh and cripple their minds.</p><h3>Shadow Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Za89UvKY41SEPD5I]{Shadow Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.iw2tS3c93Ph0aTRu]{Shadowform}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GqmxwxHqEOUbUyU6]{Devouring Plague}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.tyRV2t3TysV4x8q1]{Dispersion}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bBAxJVL3FQv59FCX]{Vampiric Embrace}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Shadow Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.AYJBs5xqw7MrqMoD]{Crown of Madness}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDissonantW]{Dissonant Whispers}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMindSpike0]{Mind Spike}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.Ohh3dmiLrYL2YW3E]{Shadow Word: Pain}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.EX24QkNdCeUOAeeV]{Summon Undead}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplVampiricTo]{Vampiric Touch}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEvardsBlac]{Evard's Black Tentacles}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.bEHmr7Vdm057Q7qg]{Psychic Horror}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominatePe]{Dominate Person}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.5Gd6t7aiE75N5uJK]{Void Eruption}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
